From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:33:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] BlueOS: own widgets' previews, default layout, no idle
 redraws
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- «Погода» and «Арона» get a preview, a name and the «BlueOS» group in
  the widget picker.
- default_workspace_4x5: the user's pages 1 and 2; AutoInstallsLayout
  places the launcher's own widgets (packageName="custom-widget").
- Idle home screen: 600 -> ~220 frames in 10 s. Live widgets redraw a
  card only when its overlay changes, the halo / icons move only by a
  visible amount (1/4 px), widgets off the screen stand still, settings
  and colours are cached; «Сейчас ничего не играет» runs once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I405d85eabdfed9521487e4461950ecf98a8c1c24
